ale":"本章节需定义药物过量（如单次或累计超量给药）、给药错误分类（错药、错剂量、错途径、错时间等）、紧急处理措施、报告路径（研究者、申办方、伦理委员会、监管）、后续随访安排及记录要求。当前允许来源未提供药物过量定义、给药错误处理规程或紧急处理流程等项目级文件。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_64e1df7d19b9488f","section_number":"6.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:adeaf313c616d79220e56965","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003053637_fff0ed70","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"SGC-R21薄膜衣片口服，每日一次，连续给药12周；随机分配至低、中、高三个剂量组之一。","quote_sha256":"8ace1cf36b66b595d5421db87c9a8e7c1ea6abacb2bbff7c393fde0afc7f758a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_65_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"筛选（V1，-28~-1天）、基线随机（V2，D1）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3–V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，W12）、末次给药后28天安全性随访（V8）。","quote_sha256":"dd63df4b3e66ae7ece55e746b97043dbd40d4385a8e4fccb4fbf1d3abe7c762d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_65_visit"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_65_dosing","es_65_visit"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认依从性评价方法（药片计数、受试者日记、电子监测或其他）、评价时点是否覆盖全部门诊访视、依从性阈值及不依从处理流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_65_method","missing_source_classes":["依从性评价操作规程","依从性记录与核查模板"],"target":"6.5 研究治疗依从性"}],"heading":"研究治疗依从性","missing_source_classes":["依从性评价操作规程","依从性记录与核查模板"],"proposal_text":"本研究治疗期为12周，受试者每日口服一次SGC-R21薄膜衣片或外观一致的安慰剂片，随机分配至低、中、高三个剂量组之一或安慰剂对照组。治疗期间安排第2周、第4周、第8周和第12周门诊访视（V3至V6），第12周同时作为治疗结束访视（V7），末次给药后28天进行安全性随访（V8）。受试者须按医嘱每日定时服用研究药物，不得自行增减剂量或中断给药。治疗期间如出现需暂停或调整给药的情况，按方案剂量调整与安全性暂停相关章节执行。","rationale":"给药方案（口服每日一次、12周、薄膜衣片、匹配安慰剂）和访视结构（V3至V8）来自当前项目已确认研究事实。依从性评价方法、是否在每个门诊访视实施、依从性阈值及不依从处理均无来源明确，不得由访视存在推断依从性检查安排，需医学经理确认后方可定稿。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_ff400724f867c4da","section_number":"6.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:adeaf313c616d79220e56965","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"cd44bbf0821de86ea6df7bdead1185c7345e480d6f7769284e4cf318aa07d4fa","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_8deea3cca149a555:full-draft:adeaf313c616d79220e56965","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:adeaf313c616d79220e56965","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:74bc4d137995a3fbc08798d185a3087639dacc8b6f5d24c66b6f3176731163ab:adeaf313c616d79220e56965","text_sha256":"cd44bbf0821de86ea6df7bdead1185c7345e480d6f7769284e4cf318aa07d4fa"},{"content_sha256":"777cdc93ca4a7fe17e838438578b2466fb5f96c6bb5a3654ef59b0b7d1fbded2","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","text_sha256":"777cdc93ca4a7fe17e838438578b2466fb5f96c6bb5a3654ef59b0b7d1fbded2"}]}